{"speciesId":243,"names":{"fr":"Raikou","es":"Raikou","en":"Raikou","ja":"ライコウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunderbolts at will. They say that it descended with lightning."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"A POKéMON that races across the land while barking a cry that sounds like crashing thunder."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"This rough POKéMON stores energy inside its body, then sweeps across the land, shooting off electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning. The roars of this POKéMON send shock waves shuddering through the air and shake the ground as if lightning bolts had come crashing down."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning. The roars of this POKéMON send shock waves shuddering through the air and shake the ground as if lightning bolts had come crashing down."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning. Its roars send shock waves shuddering through the air and ground as if lightning bolts were crashing down."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This POKéMON races across the land while barking a cry that sounds like crashing thunder."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunderbolts at will. They say that it descended with lightning."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunde